{"title":"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/2/1e2570a01092bfa02c3af4f8c60926aa3fc42626.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000 - 80 + 200 - 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"178\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/f/3efc1468881e2cdaeb78f52219d68aa330d741bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   2000  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   1600  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   2100  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   1860 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   1760  \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"521\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/09372d5097a0140e2db20def936f56f1cad13f72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000 - 80 + 200 - 120 = 1920 + 200 - 120 = 2120 - 120 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"555\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/c/81ce8cf5bee35490b93501c2be6df5efae4c1f82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200 - 80 - 120 = 200 - 200 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"253\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/e/a9e434c6def0ce61538fb29d889f750507036089.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"85\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley\">2014 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Proble